/*
 * Declares the BinaryOperatorValue class.
 *
 * BinaryOperatorValue is the abstract ancestor of all binary operator values. A
 * binary operator combines two operands using a specific operator symbol
 * (arithmetic, logical, comparison, bitwise, pointer arithmetic, etc.).
 *
 * Subclasses implement the concrete semantics for each operand type (integers,
 * floats, chars, booleans, pointers, classes, arrays, ranges…).
 *
 * <hr>
